msgid "Exceptions"
msgstr ""

#: horizon-press-news-bar/includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:269
msgid "For one-off pages. Each article and page also carries a \"News Bar\" box on its edit screen with the same two switches, which is usually quicker than listing IDs here."
msgstr ""

#: horizon-press-news-bar/includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:273
msgid "Position in the page"
msgstr ""

#: horizon-press-news-bar/includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:274
msgid "Fixed keeps the bar against the edge of the screen; inside the article it is placed between two paragraphs and scrolls away with the text."
